WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.466 --> 00:00:07.133
very romantic Potter.

00:00:09.266 --> 00:00:10.333
made you smile, though?

00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:12.366
don't get used to it.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:20.866
hi.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:21.700
don't.

00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:22.966
don't what?

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:24.400
look at me like that.

00:00:28.366 --> 00:00:29.266
don't mind us.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.500
keep going.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.166
oh it was an accident.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.033
feeding him?

00:00:48.266 --> 00:00:49.866
must be a mind control spell.

00:00:55.966 --> 00:00:56.866
scare, Malfoy?

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.466
me? of this?

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:04.700
you alright?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:05.766
perfectly!

00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:08.233
your turn.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:10.700
now that's more like you!

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:11.633
what?

00:01:12.566 --> 00:01:14.100
you seem different lately.

00:01:14.566 --> 00:01:16.100
like something's been bothering you.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:19.866
nothing's wrong, Potter.

00:01:27.666 --> 00:01:28.666
what is it?

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:29.933
nothing.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.400
a Death Eater once hid as Ron's pet rat.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:35.166
you really dislike them don't you?

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:36.533
they're monsters.

00:01:43.466 --> 00:01:44.100
my Lord.

00:01:44.433 --> 00:01:45.833
the potion worked.

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.433
when will Potter arrive?

00:01:47.766 --> 00:01:49.133
tomorrow night my Lord.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.066
my Lord! what are you doing!?

00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:55.300
just a test.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:59.400
do not fail.

